# Build state and local artifacts. Copying these in would bust the layer
# cache on every build and risk shipping a developer's SQLite file.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/.vs/
**/TestResults/

# The test project is not part of the published image.
Apex.KeyMapping.Api.Tests/

# Docs travel with the repository, not the container.
REPOSITORY.md
